=[ tomet-python ]

Python bindings for the Tomet document engine using PyO3.

==[ Overview ]

Provides native Python interoperability for parsing Tomet documents, loading
TOVE data into Python dictionaries, and converting documents into HTML,
Markdown, Typst, and Pandoc formats. It also exposes document formatting,
printing, and validation.

==[ Key Functions ]

- `loads` a data-only `.tmt` document into native Python objects.:Parse
- `parse_document` full `.tmt` markup text into a Python AST dictionary.:Parse
- `to_html` `.tmt` source or AST dictionary into an HTML body string.:Convert
- `to_markdown` `.tmt` source or AST dictionary into CommonMark.:Convert
- `to_typst` `.tmt` source or AST dictionary into Typst.:Convert
- `to_pandoc` `.tmt` source or AST dictionary into Pandoc JSON.:Convert
- `format` `.tmt` source text with the canonical formatter.:Format
- `validate` `.tmt` source against semantic constraints.:Validate
